      "message": "Merge upstream/main into issue/536-wire-taper (keep both sides)\n\nmachine/mod.rs (pub mod wire_edm + tap_gate), types/wire_edm.rs,\nwire_op.rs (stock-aware wire_params, then the taper), wire_edm_dto.rs,\nwire_page.rs and the WireContourOp test literals: taper_deg beside\nclearance. sim verify/wire open() takes the Wire, ends at wire.at(z);\nWire, polyline, gouge_at and reach move to verify/wire/kerf.rs to keep\nmod.rs under 400 lines. posted_gates/wire.rs takes taper: false; the\nvertical golden is wire_slug_punch.nc on main.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
