      "message": "fix(edm): refuse a tapered open run by name\n\nwire_contour_tapered read an open run's polyline as a closed ring and\nclosed it with a chord back across the part. A nonzero taper with an\nopen run (a chain, or side left/right) is now refused by name before\nanything is leaned. Pinned by\na_tapered_open_run_is_refused_by_name_not_closed_across_the_part (the\nreview's 13-point semicircle from the stock edge at 3 degrees).\n\nRefs #536\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
