      "message": "Merge upstream/main (#1160 no-core burnout) into issue/536-wire-taper\n\nKeep both sides: burnout beside taper_deg in WireContourOp, its DTO, the\nwire page and every test literal; WireJob carries burnout and taper.\ngenerate_wire: the burnout's rings are vertical, so a taper asked with\na burnout is refused by name (a_taper_with_a_no_core_burnout_is_refused_by_name)\ninstead of one silently dropping the other; WireCondition keeps main's\nclearance door and the PR's machine and max_taper_deg.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
